From 30967d283eafe9a6556ee86bd3069f8c0ac8b1ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <teste@hemofilia.org.br>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 01:36:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 51/51] apps: Makes wlmmixer's volume meter interactive.

The meter's bars light up in proportion to the volume, exactly: 0% at the
left end, 100% at the right, the last bar partly. Clicking on the meter
sets the volume to that position (the middle is 50%), and dragging along
it follows the pointer. Changes from elsewhere (PulseAudio, PipeWire)
show as before. The wheel still steps the volume, and a left click
elsewhere on the icon still toggles mute. With a unit test for the
position to volume mapping.
